    {
      "name": "voice-needler",
      "kind": "voice",
      "speaker": "speaker.needler",
      "description": "A young female archer and sharpshooter in her twenties: a cool, focused, slightly husky mezzo voice, precise and dry-humoured, quiet confidence, speaks low as if not to give away her position. She speaks English with a soft, neutral accent, close to the microphone in a quiet room, performing a character in a fantasy strategy game.",
      "text": "Eyes on the canopy. Needles drawn. I see them, they don't see me. Keeping my distance. Loose! Pinned. You're blocking my aim, you know. Needler, standing ready."
